e_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDM2ODU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43036856?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique","html_url":"https://github.com/cauehenrique","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauehenrique/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T02:05:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T02:05:48Z","body":"@AThousandShips Hey there! Finally figured out what's causing the issue. Sorry for the late response.\n\nIt seems that using a **WorldEnvironment** node with the Glow effect enabled causes the issue. I'm testing it right now on the 4.6rc1 (I downloaded the 4.6rc1 to test if the issue were still happening there).\n\n<img width=\"435\" height=\"609\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/947501d4-f344-449b-8d5d-73e7081f113a\" />\n\nRemoving the **WorldEnvironment** fixes the issue. I'll try to add a shader for the glow effect for now as a workaround.\n\nThe structure of my SceneTree looks somewhat like this if that's useful somehow:\n```\nControl\n    SubViewportContainer\n        SubViewport\n            Game (Node2D)\n\n    VisualEffects (CanvasLayer)\n        CRTShader (ColorRect)\n        GlowEnvironment (WorldEnvironment)\n```\n\n\n## Images of my project running\nFirst one when the node is on my SceneTree, and the second one when I remove it.\n\n<img width=\"832\" height=\"549\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c8bcdb5-40c2-400e-a79f-66f1f2276e74\" />\n\n<img width=\"832\" height=\"549\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e402c0bb-1cee-49ea-bbd1-6fcff444cda0\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3757756498/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3758733008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110601#issuecomment-3758733008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110601","id":3758733008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gCbbQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T08:23:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T08:23:23Z","body":"Thank you for the update, reopening but p